| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [i_item_id@0 ASC NULLS LAST, s_state@1 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=100                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=100), expr=[i_item_id@0 ASC NULLS LAST, s_state@1 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
